flowchart LR
    Collectors[Edge Collectors] -->|raw click events| Ingest[Ingest Buffer]
    Ingest -->|micro batches| Transform[Transform Workers]
    Transform -->|cleaned records| Warehouse[(Analytics Warehouse)]
    Transform -->|rejected rows| DeadLetter[Dead Letter Queue]
    Warehouse --> Dashboards[Reporting Dashboards]
    DeadLetter -->|manual replay| Ingest
